{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPartList","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<part-list>"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePartwise","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScoreTimewise","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartName"],"title":"Documents","anchor":"Documents"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartList"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPartList","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLPartList","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLPartListV","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The part-list identifies the different musical parts in this document. Each part has an ID that is used later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within the musical data. Since parts may be encoded separately and combined later, identification elements are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present at both the score and score-part levels. There must be at least one score-part, combined as desired","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets. Parts are ordered from top to bottom in a score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the order in which they appear in the part-list.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList\/init(items:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList\/items"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList\/Item"],"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLOpus":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLOpus"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The opus type is used for the root element of a MusicXML opus. Each opus is made up of a series of score,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"opus-link, and\/or nested opus elements. The document-attributes attribute group includes the version","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute. Future versions may include more metadata elements. In this version, we just include the title of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the opus.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLOpus","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLOpus","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlopus","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLOpus"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartList":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartList"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The part-list identifies the different musical parts in this document. Each part has an ID that is used later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within the musical data. Since parts may be encoded separately and combined later, identification elements are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present at both the score and score-part levels. There must be at least one score-part, combined as desired","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets. Parts are ordered from top to bottom in a score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the order in which they appear in the part-list.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLPartList","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartList"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/s8CopyableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Copyable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartList/items":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist\/items","kind":"symbol","title":"items","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The ordered sequence of part-group and score-part elements making up this part-list."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList\/items","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"items","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLPartListV4ItemO","text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScoreTimewise":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The score-timewise element is the root element for a timewise MusicXML score. It includes a score-header group"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"followed by a series of measures with parts inside. The document-attributes attribute group includes the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"version attribute."}],"title":"MXLScoreTimewise","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLScoreTimewise","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLScoreTimewise","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscoretimewise","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScoreTimewise"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartList/Equatable-Implementations":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist\/equatable-implementations","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList\/Equatable-Implementations","title":"Equatable Implementations","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePart":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The score-part type collects part-wide information for each part in a score. Often, each MusicXML part"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponds to a track in a Standard MIDI Format 1 file. In this case, the midi-device element is used to make"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a MIDI device or port assignment for the given track or specific MIDI instruments. Initial midi-instrument"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assignments may be made here as well. The score-instrument elements are used when there are multiple"},{"type":